    "value_statement": "Screen reader defects are hard to catch with visual testing alone. This skill guides practical VoiceOver, NVDA, JAWS, and TalkBack validation.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude screen reader testing",
      "Codex accessibility testing",
      "Claude Code ARIA validation",
      "screen reader testing",
      "VoiceOver testing",
      "NVDA testing",
